{"id":"71205f67d1e76729","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-oblivious-simulation.md","title":"Oblivious Simulation","display":"thm-oblivious-simulation — Oblivious Simulation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-oblivious-simulation","aliases":["28-thm-oblivious-simulation","Oblivious Simulation Theorem"],"display":"thm-oblivious-simulation — Oblivious Simulation","depends_on":["[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-time-constructible]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"34","source_pdf_pages":"60","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-oblivious-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-oblivious-simulation</span><span>Oblivious Simulation Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-oblivious-simulation — Oblivious Simulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91b637dbdbd7a2c3\" href=\"?note=91b637dbdbd7a2c3\" title=\"28-df-oblivious-tm\">28-df-oblivious-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"60"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a>。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)\\)</span>。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91b637dbdbd7a2c3\" href=\"?note=91b637dbdbd7a2c3\" title=\"28-df-oblivious-tm\">28-df-oblivious-tm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists M&#39;\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(\\operatorname{Obl}(M&#39;)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M&#39;(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{M&#39;}(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\lceil\\log_2(t(|x|)+2)\\rceil)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists M&#39;\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(\\operatorname{Obl}(M&#39;)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M&#39;(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{M&#39;}(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\lceil\\log_2(t(|x|)+2)\\rceil)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补回时间可构造条件，并保持完整函数输出，不仅保持接受语言。陈述已与原书练习及 §2.3 的模拟说明核对；此处未展开 Hennie–Stearns 型模拟的完整证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Exercise 1.6，印刷 p.34 / PDF p.60。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：Hennie–Stearns型无知觉模拟尚未展开完整证明。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-oblivious-tm","status":"resolved","id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-time-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，see [[28-df-time-constructible]]。对所有 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ 有 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)$。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，see [[28-df-time-constructible]]。对所有 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ 有 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)$。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oblivious-tm","status":"resolved","id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，see [[28-df-time-constructible]]。对所有 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ 有 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)$。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists M'\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(\\operatorname{Obl}(M')\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M'(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{M'}(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|)\\lceil\\log_2(t(|x|)+2)\\rceil)).","display":true}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通用与标准化机器：[[28-df-universal-tm]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]、[[28-thm-oblivious-simulation]]。"}],"outgoing":["91b637dbdbd7a2c3","b5d4fc2d291ce98b","35bdb2233dfc3e43"]}